<div class="space-y-6">

  <!-- Growth Loops Explained -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-teal-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-green-200">
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">What Are Growth Loops?</h3>
    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
      A growth loop is a system where an output becomes an input. Unlike linear funnels (spend money → get customers → done),
      loops create compounding growth: each user/action creates more users/actions.
    </p>
    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600"><strong>Example:</strong> User invites friend → Friend signs up → Friend invites their friend → More signups (Viral Loop)</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- The Three Core Loops -->
  <div class="space-y-4">

    <!-- Viral Loop -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-purple-200 shadow-lg">
      <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
        <div class="text-4xl mr-3">🔁</div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">1. Viral Loop</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Users bring more users</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-4">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">How It Works:</h4>
        <div class="bg-purple-50 rounded-lg p-4 mb-3">
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">User signs up → Gets value → Invites friends (because it's better together) → Friends sign up → Repeat</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-green-700 mb-2 text-sm">✅ Good Examples</h4>
          <ul class="text-xs space-y-1 text-gray-700">
            <li>• Dropbox: Get extra storage for referrals</li>
            <li>• Notion: Invite team = shared workspace</li>
            <li>• WhatsApp: More friends = more value</li>
            <li>• Calendly: Each meeting invite is an ad</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2 text-sm">🔑 Key Metrics</h4>
          <ul class="text-xs space-y-1 text-gray-700">
            <li>• <strong>K-factor:</strong> Invites per user</li>
            <li>• <strong>Conversion:</strong> % who accept invite</li>
            <li>• <strong>Cycle time:</strong> Days from signup to invite</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-4 p-3 bg-amber-50 rounded-lg">
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-700"><strong>Build This If:</strong> Your product is multiplayer, collaborative, or has network effects.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Content Loop -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-blue-200 shadow-lg">
      <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
        <div class="text-4xl mr-3">📝</div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">2. Content Loop (SEO)</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Content brings users who create more content</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-4">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">How It Works:</h4>
        <div class="bg-blue-50 rounded-lg p-4 mb-3">
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Create content → Ranks on Google → Drives traffic → Users create more content → More pages rank → Repeat</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-green-700 mb-2 text-sm">✅ Good Examples</h4>
          <ul class="text-xs space-y-1 text-gray-700">
            <li>• Pinterest: Pins rank, drive signups, users pin more</li>
            <li>• Yelp: Reviews rank for "[city] restaurants"</li>
            <li>• Stack Overflow: Q&A ranks for tech problems</li>
            <li>• TripAdvisor: Hotel reviews = SEO goldmine</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2 text-sm">🔑 Key Metrics</h4>
          <ul class="text-xs space-y-1 text-gray-700">
            <li>• <strong>Pages indexed:</strong> Google coverage</li>
            <li>• <strong>Organic traffic:</strong> Monthly visits</li>
            <li>• <strong>Content created:</strong> UGC per user</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-4 p-3 bg-amber-50 rounded-lg">
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-700"><strong>Build This If:</strong> Your product generates user-created content (reviews, posts, listings, Q&A).</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Paid Loop -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-orange-200 shadow-lg">
      <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
        <div class="text-4xl mr-3">💰</div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">3. Paid Loop</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Revenue funds more customer acquisition</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-4">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">How It Works:</h4>
        <div class="bg-orange-50 rounded-lg p-4 mb-3">
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Spend $100 on ads → Acquire customer → Customer pays $300 → Reinvest $300 in ads → Acquire 3 customers → Repeat</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-green-700 mb-2 text-sm">✅ Works When:</h4>
          <ul class="text-xs space-y-1 text-gray-700">
            <li>• LTV significantly higher than CAC (3:1+ ratio)</li>
            <li>• Fast payback period (< 6 months)</li>
            <li>• Repeatable ad performance</li>
            <li>• Strong retention (keep customers long-term)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2 text-sm">🔑 Key Metrics</h4>
          <ul class="text-xs space-y-1 text-gray-700">
            <li>• <strong>CAC:</strong> Cost to acquire customer</li>
            <li>• <strong>LTV:</strong> Lifetime value per customer</li>
            <li>• <strong>Payback:</strong> Months to recover CAC</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-4 p-3 bg-red-50 rounded-lg border border-red-200">
        <p class="text-xs text-red-800"><strong>⚠️ Warning:</strong> Don't start with paid ads until you have proven retention and unit economics.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Building Your First Loop -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-purple-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-blue-200">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">How to Build Your First Growth Loop</h3>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">1</div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Map Your Current User Journey</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Write down every step from awareness to active user. Look for natural sharing moments.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">2</div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Identify One Loop Type That Fits</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Pick viral if multiplayer, content if UGC-driven, paid if you have strong unit economics.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">3</div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Build the Smallest Version</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Don't over-engineer. Simple invite button, basic SEO, small ad budget. Ship fast.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">4</div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Measure Loop Velocity</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">How long from input to output? Shorten cycle time by removing friction.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">5</div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Optimize One Variable at a Time</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Increase k-factor OR shorten cycle time OR improve conversion. Don't change everything at once.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Validation Framework -->
  <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-gray-200 shadow-lg">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Validation Checklist</h3>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-green-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Problem Validated</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">10+ customer interviews confirming pain exists and they're actively looking for solutions</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-green-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Solution Validated</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">5+ users actively using MVP and reporting it solves their problem</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-green-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Willingness to Pay</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">At least 3 users paid (even $1) or committed to pay when you launch</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-green-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Channel Validated</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">You know where your customers hang out and have acquired users through that channel</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-green-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Retention Signal</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Users come back weekly (or appropriate frequency for your product)</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
